// The closed list of Arithmetic field value types (FieldValueKind::Arithmetic): the
// types an operator is instantiated for when the arithmetic on the values is not
// that of each scalar separately. FUSE_ARITHMETIC_TYPE(C++ type, value_traits name).
// A type that is not here is refused by name wherever an operator would have to
// do arithmetic on it; adding one is adding a line here, with the type's
// `limb_count`/`load_value`/`store_value` in fuse/num/arithmetic_kernels.hpp, and
// its row in test/num/arithmetic_kernels_test.cpp.
FUSE_ARITHMETIC_TYPE(fuse::num::dd, "dd")
FUSE_ARITHMETIC_TYPE(fuse::num::qd, "qd")
